## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
advanced-data-modeling-project/

├── GlobalSuperStore_Data.xlsx
├── create_database.sql
├── Step3_StarSchema.sql
├── GlobalSuperStore.twb
├── er_diagram.png
├── Step3_StarSchema_Diagram.png
└── star_schema_verification.jpg
```

| File                           | Description                                  |
| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |
| `GlobalSuperStore_Data.xlsx`   | Source dataset                               |
| `create_database.sql`          | Relational database creation script          |
| `Step3_StarSchema.sql`         | Star schema creation and data-loading script |
| `GlobalSuperStore.twb`         | Tableau workbook                             |
| `er_diagram.png`               | ER diagram                                   |
| `Step3_StarSchema_Diagram.png` | Star schema diagram                          |
| `star_schema_verification.jpg` | Star schema verification                     |

